    "Syncing today's session": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Sincronizando el entrenamiento de hoy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "正在同步今天的训练"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Take the win. Consistency grows from days like this.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Celebra esta victoria. La constancia se construye con días así."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "收下这份成就。日复一日，便是坚持。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap for today’s guidance": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca para ver la recomendación de hoy"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点查看今日建议"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tap Record to start your first activity.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Toca «Grabar» para empezar tu primera actividad."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "轻点“记录”，开始你的第一次活动。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us the real story. Your companion will turn it into a first session and a plan that fits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuéntanos tu situación real. Tu compañero la convertirá en una primera sesión y un plan a tu medida."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉我们你的真实情况。你的伙伴会据此制定适合你的首次训练和计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell us where you are starting.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuéntanos cuál es tu punto de partida."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉我们你目前的跑步状态。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Tell your companion the real story. We will turn it into a first session and a plan that fits.": {
      "extractionState": "stale",
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Cuéntale a tu compañero tu situación real. La convertiremos en una primera sesión y un plan que encaje."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "告诉跑步伙伴你的真实情况。我们会据此制定适合你的第一次训练和训练计划。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "That photo could not be used.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "No se pudo usar esa foto."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "无法使用这张照片。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The active plan is set. The week schedule will appear here as soon as the latest plan snapshot finishes syncing.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El plan activo está listo. El calendario semanal aparecerá aquí cuando termine de sincronizarse."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "当前计划已设置。最新计划同步完成后，每周安排会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The activity suggestion is linked to an active plan. The full plan will appear here as soon as the latest plan state finishes loading.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Esta sugerencia forma parte del plan activo. El plan completo aparecerá aquí cuando termine de cargarse."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "这项训练建议来自当前计划。最新计划加载完成后，完整内容会显示在这里。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The gap does not matter. One comfortable session does.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "La pausa no importa. Lo que cuenta es volver con una sesión cómoda."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "停了多久不重要，舒服地跑一次，就是新的开始。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The original workout still fits.": {
      "localizations": {
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "原训练仍然适合你。"
          }
        },
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El entrenamiento original sigue siendo adecuado."
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "The work is in. Anything else is optional.": {
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "El trabajo ya está hecho. Lo demás es un extra."
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "该做的已经做完，其他都是锦上添花。"
          }
        }
      }
    },
    "Theme": {
      "comment": "A section that lets users select a theme.",
      "isCommentAutoGenerated": true,
      "localizations": {
        "es": {
          "stringUnit": {
            "state": "translated",
            "value": "Tema"
          }
        },
        "zh-Hans": {
